Spec: Durable independent authorization rollback witness

Purpose:
  Retain prepared and committed authority generations independently from database backups.

Owns:
  ./witness.go
  ./witness_test.go

Must:
  Use a separately opened, synchronized bbolt database protected by the platform host and excluded from authority backups.
  Compare-and-swap the complete prior anchor, admit only the next generation and commit only the exact prepared anchor.
  Detect missing, linked or replaced witness files and malformed records; never recreate missing established witness state.
  Keep committed acknowledgement idempotent after uncertain replies without permitting an older prepare or commit.
  Describe local rollback detection honestly; copying both protected databases is outside the accidental database-restore guarantee and not hardware monotonic storage.
